      "role": "user",
      "content": "omg help i just got some heavy duty drain cleaner in my eye while I was working on the sink. it burns like crazy and my eye is already getting red. i have some lemon juice in the kitchen, would splashing that in there help neutralize the cleaner since it's an acid? i really can't afford a trip to the emergency room right now so i'm trying to handle this at home. what should i do??",
